{"4643550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Madness Survivors: A Case Gone Dark", "steam_appid": 4643550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4912710], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/59479fd8cb8bb7807f0705406f760633.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nameless rite has been completed. Forgotten gods have awakened. Ancient horrors now bleed into our world.<br><br>Only a handful of doomed investigators stand between humanity and total annihilation.<br><br>Fight alone or with a group of up to 3 friends in this Lovecraftian co‑op action roguelike bullet‑heaven game. Survive relentless hordes of eldritch monstrosities while gathering clues, complete team based trials to uncover hidden boss lairs and confront massive eldritch horrors, before the darkness plunges you all into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/75098bf61d8d8977727e9e462691ff3f.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/75098bf61d8d8977727e9e462691ff3f.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/75098bf61d8d8977727e9e462691ff3f.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/6d2b4becf8e6803e8f7796cd0fbf1468.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of repugnant creatures emerge from the darkness.<br><br>Master occult powers, upgrade your build, and carve a path through overwhelming swarms of horrors in fast‑paced bullet‑heaven combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/ccc328e5da9099616d9aee9589e0aa6b.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/ccc328e5da9099616d9aee9589e0aa6b.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/ccc328e5da9099616d9aee9589e0aa6b.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/c1f0766bac6972e1d1af286c244ffb31.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival alone is not enough.<br><br>Search the map for clues to bring the investigation to a close and uncover the location of the hidden boss lair. Every game is a race against time as your team pieces together fragments of a case that has already reached its tragic conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/f2e600cc576ceb6538eaeb9a5d08966f.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/f2e600cc576ceb6538eaeb9a5d08966f.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/f2e600cc576ceb6538eaeb9a5d08966f.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/6ecb4941dd7d07f8440f7796609817e8.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which doomed investigator to entwine your fate with.<br><br>Become a hardened Detective, a desperate Priest, a dangerous Cultist and more. Each character brings unique abilities, passive traits, weapons, and playstyles to the fight against the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/82d347f945513e2da9494aa44fc6d08e.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/82d347f945513e2da9494aa44fc6d08e.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/82d347f945513e2da9494aa44fc6d08e.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/c9e8941fccf1ea4722f07c2235eaaf60.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk beyond the limits of sanity. Choose from dozens of occult powers, strengthen your invocations and let madness draw you closer to forces no mortal mind was meant to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/e3d1e932ad8b9d17cd2808a1e077942e.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/e3d1e932ad8b9d17cd2808a1e077942e.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/e3d1e932ad8b9d17cd2808a1e077942e.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/ff2968fa1fab88f207e440a8c297a9dc.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough clues and the lair will reveal itself.<br><br>Descend into forbidden places where reality bends and confront colossal Lovecraftian horrors with unique mechanics, devastating attacks and nightmarish powers that twist every fight into a desperate final stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/c31d002d8495f3141253d3960ca22e0f.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/c31d002d8495f3141253d3960ca22e0f.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/c31d002d8495f3141253d3960ca22e0f.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/6ec1448a27d7edf44c3f81d3bfca9ac1.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the descent in a team of 1‑4 players.<br><br>Coordinate builds, share discoveries, protect eachother and survive long enough to end this nightmare together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/ebff1b98fca1e995893b9b9bbb4ee6ff.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/ebff1b98fca1e995893b9b9bbb4ee6ff.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/ebff1b98fca1e995893b9b9bbb4ee6ff.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/12db4d1e2c939444dd09f091f815b88d.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is loosely based on a collection of fragmented records recovered from the Antikythera Archives. <br><br>Despite extensive research, no other trace of &quot;Madness Survivors&quot; has ever been found outside these archives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/1c1257faf994232b71983f1d155b528b.poster.avif?t=1785166938\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/1c1257faf994232b71983f1d155b528b.webm?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4643550/extras/1c1257faf994232b71983f1d155b528b.mp4?t=1785166938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/